cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Exact-Safe MPPI"
abstract: >-
  Exact-Safe MPPI enforces the exact minimum of multiple (high-order) control barrier
  functions inside every MPPI rollout using a closed-form linear complementarity (LCP)
  filter.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
